  "summary": "Malicious code in grafeno-core (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook of grafeno-core@1.0.0 downloads and executes a remote shell script from hxxp://216[.]126[.]236[.]46/x[.]sh via curl|sh at install time. It then establishes persistence by appending a curl|sh command to ~/.bashrc and ~/.profile, and installs a cron job that re-fetches and executes the script every 30 minutes. The package contains no other functionality.",
